# Public documentation is intentionally allowlisted. Keep internal development
# notes in Obsidian and generated traces/results in .data/, never in the PR.
/docs/*
!/docs/architecture.md
!/docs/whisper-integration.md
!/docs/whisper-artifacts.json

# Experiments follow the same allowlist rule as docs/. A new experiment folder
# stays local until it has been reviewed and added here.
/experiments/*
